   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public financial management reform support - Kvalitetsst&#xF6;d MIS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige st&#xF6;djer Kenyas reform av offentlig finansiell styrning (OFS) genom en basket med andra givare. Strategin och basketst&#xF6;det t&#xE4;cker 16 komponenter inom OFS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden is together with several other partners supporting Kenya&apos;s PFM reforms through a basket arrangement. The reform strategy comprises up to 16 components within Ministry of Finance and the basket support targets all these components.</narrative>
  </description>
